16
00:00:47,184 --> 00:00:50,294
AI can draft your report. People decide what it says.

17
00:00:51,570 --> 00:00:55,221
Built for health equity, rural health, and small teams doing more.

18
00:00:56,501 --> 00:00:59,203
Walk into your budget meeting with real numbers.

19
00:01:00,070 --> 00:01:04,208
Bring CB-CAP to your county. Talk to the SozoRock Foundation.

20
00:01:04,988 --> 00:01:06,731
Care. For every zip code.
